# Build output
/target/
/dist/*
!/dist/freeze/
!/dist/freeze/**
/Cargo.lock

# Local scratch. Nothing under docs/ is ignored: docs/blueprint.md is the
# design contract and MUST be tracked. The previous repository ignored
# /docs/* and /audit/, which is how the entire design package ended up
# outside version control.
*.log
*.bak
/scratch/

# Third-party sources cloned for research only. Never enters the product tree.
/clone/
